SCOPE

This licence covers the documentation in this repository — the prose, diagrams
and configuration examples under `docs/`, and the MkDocs configuration that
builds them.

It does NOT cover the PureChain execution client, which lives in a separate
repository and remains under its original go-ethereum licences: LGPL-3.0 for
the library and GPL-3.0 for the binaries. See
https://github.com/gieworld/purechain_testnet

Code samples embedded in this documentation may be used without restriction
and without attribution; the attribution requirement is intended for the prose
and diagrams, not for a two-line shell snippet.
